CHAPTER.VERS:
And it came to pass, when David and his men were come to Ziklag on the third 
        day, that the Amalekites had invaded the south, and Ziklag, and smitten 
        Ziklag, and burned it with fire;

And when David 
        came to Ziklag, he sent of the spoil to the elders of Judah,  to his friends, saying, Behold a present for you of the spoil of the enemies of the LORD; 

          present: Heb. blessing
